config CFS_FS
	tristate "CFS - Ceph File System Simple"
	depends on CEPH_LIB
	select NLS
	help
	  CFS is a simple file system that stores metadata and data in
	  Ceph RADOS object store. It is designed for simple distributed
	  file storage with:
	  
	  - Metadata stored in RADOS omap (key-value store)
	  - File data stored in 4MB sliced objects
	  - POSIX-compliant file system interface
	  
	  Metadata (directory entries, inode attributes) are stored in
	  the meta pool using omap, with directory entries keyed by
	  hash_filename format.
	  
	  File data is sliced into 4MB chunks and stored in data pool
	  objects named inode.partnum.
	  
	  To compile this file system as a module, choose M here.
	  If unsure, say N.